| `wall-bounce` | {{#unless (eq engine.slug "none")}}`CUES.wallBounce` | {{/unless}}The ball reflects off the top or bottom wall, or off a paddle's end cap. |
| `obstacle-bounce` | {{#unless (eq engine.slug "none")}}`CUES.obstacleBounce` | {{/unless}}The ball bounces off an obstacle. |
